mischievous expression or pose, but I'll leave it up to you. Please draw them as you like.\nIf possible, a background like a waterfront would be appreciated (even a simple one). (A simple background is also fine.) I would appreciate it if you could take your time.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw it slowly. Thank you very much.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@sianntyu3/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2689860, "client_id": 2026904, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fb9160931a35861d590a350a9736541", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fb9160931a35861d590a350a9736541, https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1aeb4930e0bb00a0369d5cbe0704edbc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78fc7b6e16be905d91acf47dfb7abc33 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=786dd2f5ee95b88972a54cd23956a32b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=786dd2f5ee95b88972a54cd23956a32b, https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf4c0ea8ad9c33d352f09e24167f868a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a558e6/uploads/origins/1909566c-64e7-4290-a4fc-8269e7ad7fa4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1834916b495958aa77a33d8afcce3c24 3x"}, "body": "I am pondering the name. Dear Sir or Madam\nMy name is Lilika Kanzaki, and I am a private Vtuber.\nI would like to send you a request to draw myself.\n\nI would like to draw myself.\nI would like an illustration of Lirika Kanzaki, a VTuber who loves to be goofy and cute and is a member of the \"Chemomimi\" school discipline committee!\nIf you can let me hold a gun, I will leave the other themes and poses up to you.\nWe would like to use it as a thumbnail,\n　I would appreciate it if you could draw the top of her head and the area around her face so that I can use them as thumbnails.\nWe would be very happy if you could add facial expressions to the extent possible!\n　(Please don't be too hard on us!).\n\n(Please don't be unreasonable!) [Intended use\nUse on social networking services such as Twitter.\nUse on our monetized YouTube channel\nUse in FANBOX\n\nDelivery format\nWe apologize for the inconvenience.\nWe would greatly appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data in which the person, background, address, etc. are layered!\n\n\nI am very embarrassed to say that I do not yet have a three-view drawing, so I would appreciate it if you could refer to the full-body image in the tree of my fixed tweets on Twitter.\n\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Kanzaki_Ririka/status/1577648227880677377", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 734293, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "けんいち", "screen_name": "ken1ro_u", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.